  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Sourced Role to support Green Growth Nepal Programme.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme funded position will be dedicated to supporting components 1 and 2. This is required because the investment focus of these components is primarily large-scale infrastructure. Furthermore, Green Growth Nepal is testing new approaches to mobilise investment from British Investment Partnerships at the federal level and for large cities. The position will be based in Kathmandu with frequent travel to the selected large cities. This role will be recruited following BEK recruitment policy.</narrative>
  </description>
